# TreeTagger Romanian tagset (MULTEXT-East)
#
# Romanian TreeTagger Part-of-Speech Tags following the MULTEXT-East morphosyntactic
# descriptors (MSD). The coarse part-of-speech is determined by the first character
# of each tag:
#   N=noun (Np=proper -> POS_PROPN)   V=verb (Va=auxiliary -> POS_AUX)
#   A=adjective  P=pronoun  D=determiner  T=article (-> POS_DET)  M=numeral
#   R=adverb  S=adposition  C=conjunction (Cc=coordinating; Cr/Cs=subordinating)
#   Q=particle  I=interjection  Y=abbreviation (-> POS_X)  X=residual
# Punctuation is emitted as named tokens (COLON, COMMA, HYPHEN, PAREN, QUOTE,
# SENT, SLASH) -> POS_PUNCT.
#
# Source: extracted from the TreeTagger model using TT4J
__META_SOURCE_URL__=https\://www.sketchengine.eu/romanian-tagset/
__META_SOURCE_URL__.1=https\://nl.ijs.si/ME/V4/msd/html/msd-ro.html
__META_TYPE_BASE__=de.tudarmstadt.ukp.dkpro.core.api.lexmorph.type.pos.

